---- report
dropped excerpt excerpt: Tumblr has no excerpt field; the excerpt is left out
degraded cover_in_body cover: Tumblr has no cover image; the cover goes at the top of the post
degraded inline_code p1: Tumblr has no inline code; it is plain text
degraded gallery_caption_as_text gal: Tumblr galleries have no caption of their own; it goes in a line under the photos
degraded video_caption_as_text vid: Tumblr videos have no caption; it goes in a line under the video
degraded audio_as_link aud: Tumblr gets the sound file as a link to it on your media host
degraded list_start ol: Tumblr numbers every list from 1; this list started at 3
degraded code_as_text code: Tumblr has no code blocks; the code is monospaced text, without its empty lines
degraded divider_as_text hr: Tumblr has no dividers; a line of * * * stands for it
